          "kicker": "Recruitment push",
          "heading": "Fiji Rugby confirm interest in recruiting Mark Nawaqanitawase for the World Cup",
          "body": "Fiji Rugby have confirmed interest in recruiting Mark Nawaqanitawase for the World Cup, a report first run about a week ago. It lands as Jake White, named head coach on Tuesday from 31 applicants, takes charge of a side ranked 10th in the world. Fiji are in Pool C at the 2027 World Cup in Australia with Argentina, Canada and Spain."
