        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Thomas Ramos ruled out of France's autumn Nations Championship with thigh setback",
          "body": "According to L'Equipe, Thomas Ramos will miss all four of France's autumn matches after aggravating a thigh injury first picked up in September. Les Bleus have chosen to rest him for the rest of the autumn rather than risk a longer problem. The loss of their main goal-kicker, who kicked the winning penalty against England in the 2026 Six Nations, lands with Jalibert, Meafou and Marchand already on the injury list. Galthié is expected to name his 42-man squad on Wednesday."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "England women's unbeaten run ends with 24-21 defeat to Canada",
