      "edition": "Wednesday 21 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Farrell set to name Ireland squad with Caelan Doris still sidelined",
          "body": "Andy Farrell is set to name his Ireland squad for the second Nations Championship window, with Caelan Doris still sidelined and some welcome returnees expected, according to The42. Ireland host Argentina in Dublin before facing Fiji and then the Springboks, and Farrell will be demanding more accuracy and energy after what The42 called an error-strewn defeat to New Zealand in Auckland in July."
