          "heading": "Italy lost 32-14 to South Africa at home in November 2025",
          "body": "Italy lost 32-14 to South Africa at home in November 2025, in an international friendly. Next they meet South Africa in Round 4 of the Nations Championship. So far in the competition, Italy have played three matches, won none and lost three. Their points tally is 37 scored and 131 conceded. Italy's points difference over those matches is -94."
