          "kicker": "Honours revoked",
          "heading": "Stuart Hogg stripped of MBE over domestic abuse conviction this year",
          "body": "Former Scotland captain Stuart Hogg has lost his MBE after pleading guilty to a domestic abuse charge involving his estranged wife. The honour, awarded in the 2024 New Year Honours for services to rugby, was removed in March and the decision confirmed that month. Hogg won 100 caps for Scotland and toured three times with the British & Irish Lions. The Cabinet Office's register lists him among 15 people whose honours have been revoked in 2026."
        },
        {
