          "kicker": "Coaching move",
          "heading": "Argentina give Shaun Edwards blessing as he reveals England job talks",
          "body": "Argentina have given Shaun Edwards their blessing to explore the England job, and Edwards has revealed he has held talks about it. For the Pumas, it is a coaching story arriving ahead of their next test against Ireland, with the outcome of the England talks still unclear from the coverage."
