    "463": {
      "date": "2026-10-21",
      "edition": "Wednesday 21 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Sevens double",
          "heading": "Japan men's sevens beat Hong Kong China 28-14 in Colombo final",
          "body": "In sevens, Japan's men beat Hong Kong China 28-14 in the final of Asia Rugby Emirates Sevens Series leg two in Colombo, a rare defeat for the defending series champions. The sides meet often, but Japan were deserved winners this time. The women's Sakura Sevens also took the leg, beating China 14-7 to claim the series, and they now turn their attention to HSBC SVNS, which starts in Dubai at the end of November."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "England women's unbeaten run ends with 24-21 defeat to Canada",
